===========================================
           GLADLANG ENUM TESTS             
===========================================

--- Test 1: Basic Enums ---
Colors.RED:  Colors.RED
Colors.GREEN:  Colors.GREEN
Colors.BLUE:  Colors.BLUE

  RED value = 0 (correct)
  GREEN value = 1 (correct)
  BLUE value = 2 (correct)

--- Test 2: Explicit & Auto-Incrementing Values ---
HTTPStatus.OK:  HTTPStatus.OK
HTTPStatus.NOT_FOUND:  HTTPStatus.NOT_FOUND
HTTPStatus.SERVER_ERROR:  HTTPStatus.SERVER_ERROR
HTTPStatus.CUSTOM_ERROR:  HTTPStatus.CUSTOM_ERROR
  OK.value = 200 (correct)
  CUSTOM_ERROR.value = 501 (correct, auto-increment works)

--- Test 3: Comma-Separated Enums ---
Days.MON:  Days.MON
Days.WED:  Days.WED
Days.FRI:  Days.FRI
  MON.value = 0 (correct)
  WED.value = 2 (correct)
  FRI.value = 4 (correct)

--- Test 4: Enum Object Immutability ---
Attempting to reassign the entire 'Colors' Enum...
SUCCESS: Caught expected error ->  Cannot reassign constant 'Colors'

--- Test 5: Enum Case Immutability ---
Attempting to reassign 'Colors.RED' to 10...
SUCCESS: Caught expected error ->  Cannot reassign enum case 'RED'

--- Test 6: Invalid Case Access ---
Attempting to access non-existent 'Colors.YELLOW'...
SUCCESS: Caught expected error ->  Enum 'Colors' has no case 'YELLOW'

--- Testing Encapsulated Enums ---
Server initialized with Status:  Status.OFFLINE

Accessing Public Enum 'Role.ADMIN'...
Result:  Role.ADMIN

Attempting to access Private Enum 'Status.OFFLINE' from outside...
SUCCESS: Caught expected error ->  Cannot access private static field 'Status'

--- Test 8: Duplicate Enum Case Names ---
Attempting to create enum with duplicate case (should fail)...
SUCCESS: Caught expected error -> Duplicate enum case 'FIRST'

--- Test 9: Enum Member Comparisons ---
r1 == r2:  1
r1 == g:   0
r1 != g:   1
r1 IS r2:  1
r1 IS g:   0
  PASS: Same enum member compares equal
  PASS: Different enum members compare not equal

--- Test 10: Accessing .value Attribute ---
Colors.RED.value =  0
Colors.GREEN.value =  1
Colors.BLUE.value =  2
HTTPStatus.OK.value =  200
HTTPStatus.CUSTOM_ERROR.value =  501
  PASS: RED.value = 0

--- Test 11: Enum in IF Conditions ---
  PASS: Enum member is truthy
  PASS: RED.value = 0

